<title>UK: Cadbury down after analyst meeting.</title>
<headline>Cadbury down after analyst meeting.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Cadbury Schweppes Plc dipped two percent on Monday after the drinks-to-confectionery group held a meeting with analysts at its broker ABN AMRO Hoare Govett, traders said.</p>
<p>By 1508 GMT, the stock was down 10 pence at 476-1/2.</p>
<p>Analysts at Hoare Govett were not immediately available for comment and no feedback from the meeting was immediately forthcoming.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
